Error [jet.ProhibitedEffectReached]: `quiet` reaches a function whose row names a kind of `Log`, which it prohibits with `-[!Log]>`
  --> tests/ui/effects/package_effect_denying_parent_denies_kind_is_e0749.jet:7:16
    |
  7 | quiet: fn() -[!Log]> { record() }
    |                ^^^
 Why: A package effect with `parent: Log` is a kind of `Log`, so denying `Log` denies every kind of it, through every callee the function can reach
 Fix: Remove the call that introduces the kind of `Log`, or drop the `-[!Log]>` prohibition
Denial: invocation
Call chain: quiet
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0749
